    (hv₀ : 0 < v₀) (hv : v₀ ≤ C.volume τ₀)
    (hφmono : MonotoneOn φ (Set.Ioi 0)) (hφ : φ v₀ = κ)
    (comparison : BallVolumeComparison M μ K C φ r₀) :
    KappaNoncollapsingCertificate M μ K κ r₀
```

Good: all hypotheses explicit in signature, comparison last (or before). Also `NormalizedBallVolumeLowerBound.toKappaNoncollapsingCertificate` uses the K1↔K2 equivalence — perfect for "K1<->K2 equivalence is reused".

