6. `NCF-6 reduced-length differential inequality` — l_τ - Δl + |∇l|² - R + n/(2τ) ≥ 0 and its integrated form.
7. `NCF-7 differentiation under the integral` — differentiation of Ṽ(τ) under the integral sign (dominated convergence).
8. `NCF-8 reduced-volume monotonicity` — Ṽ nonincreasing in backward time; represented by the `ReducedVolumeCertificate` fields.
9. `NCF-9 ball-volume comparison` — the collapsed-ball/small-reduced-volume comparison; supplied as `BallVolumeComparison`.
10. `NCF-10 ancient solution rigidity` — a complete ancient solution with bounded curvature and Ṽ ≡ const is the Gaussian shrinker/Euclidean; needed for the equality case.
11. `NCF-11 no-local-collapsing compactness` — the pointed compactness/blow-up argument extracting the ancient limit solution.
12. `NCF-12 normalisation and uniform κ` — the normalisation Ṽ(0) = 1 and the extraction of a κ > 0 depending only on g(0) and T.

